{"id": "ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue01", "kind": "audio", "suite": "passages", "category": "conversation", "media": "passages/ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue01.wav", "reference": "うん。\nなんか車で何時間か行ったところにお茶どころが、あるんだけど\nはいはいはい。\nその\nお茶\nが\nすごい、美味しいっていうか何だろう独特な飲み方をする、ところがあって\nうんうん。\nなんか普通のお茶ぐびぐびって飲むんじゃなくて緑茶なんだけど何だろう\n雫をこう、ポタポタポタって、飲むみたいな\nえー。\n飲み方するところがあって、なんかそれは\n久しぶりにうち。私結婚してるんだけど\nうん。\n旦那さんと、私で二人で共通のこう、マイブームじゃないけど\nえー。\nヒットしてなんかそこはねなんか、定期的には行ってるかもしれない。", "language": "ja", "group": "ingcrowd-themed-dialogue", "source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue01/japanese-themed-dialogue01_audio.wav", "transcript_source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue01/japanese-themed-dialogue01.eaf", "license": "CC BY-NC 4.0", "credit": "IngCrowd Inc., Japanese Themed Casual Conversation Corpus", "theme": "Entertainment and hobbies", "start_seconds": 310.85, "end_seconds": 352.67, "duration_seconds": 41.82, "transcript_granularity": "publisher human verbatim, timestamped speaker turns", "annotation_ids": ["a196", "a102", "a197", "a103", "a104", "a105", "a106", "a198", "a107", "a108", "a199", "a109", "a110", "a200", "a111", "a201", "a112"], "transcript_policy": "Sort ELAN segments by start time, retain spoken fills and source punctuation, omit the laughter markup. Separate overlapping turns in start-time order.", "sha256": "91098d27a400281e71812fb48c128d17c8ffae40a5fe3b37405c65b41490a01f"}
{"id": "ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue07", "kind": "audio", "suite": "passages", "category": "conversation_overlap", "media": "passages/ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue07.wav", "reference": "まあでも今は皆たいがい格安だよね。\nうーん。逆に最近\n格安じゃない人に出会わないかも。\nまそうだよね。キャリア\nうん。\nキャリア。いないなー。\nそうだよね。結構とし\nあの親世代ぐらいだよね。だいたいね。\nあっ確かに。うん。うちの親まだキャリアかもしれない。\nやっぱお店に行って契約しないとみたいな感じ\nうん。うんうんうん。面倒くさいからもうええわって言ってはったかなー。\nがある。\nそうそうそう。\nだからドコモかなんか、とかでやってる。\nうんうーん。", "language": "ja", "group": "ingcrowd-themed-dialogue", "source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue07/japanese-themed-dialogue07_audio.wav", "transcript_source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue07/japanese-themed-dialogue07.eaf", "license": "CC BY-NC 4.0", "credit": "IngCrowd Inc., Japanese Themed Casual Conversation Corpus", "theme": "Internet and communications", "start_seconds": 545.49, "end_seconds": 575.11, "duration_seconds": 29.62, "transcript_granularity": "publisher human verbatim, timestamped speaker turns", "annotation_ids": ["a165", "a255", "a256", "a166", "a257", "a258", "a167", "a168", "a259", "a169", "a260", "a170", "a171", "a172", "a261"], "transcript_policy": "Sort ELAN segments by start time, retain spoken fills and source punctuation, omit the laughter markup. Separate overlapping turns in start-time order.", "sha256": "9e30b02a5e64ca13f07a3a755a3a762c9d579097b6063101afefec899f81c998"}
{"id": "ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue10", "kind": "audio", "suite": "passages", "category": "conversation_overlap", "media": "passages/ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue10.wav", "reference": "でーなんかほんとその時はそういう感じだったけど\n何だろうね。急に\nいや、なんか一日何か一個やろうみたいな感じになって\nほおー、うんうんうん。\nから、なんか、ほんとすごい何でもいい。別に水を\nのなんかめっちゃいっぱい飲むとか何でもいいんだけどなんかそういう小さいところから\nうんうんうんうんうん。\nうんうん。\n始めてったらまあた多分、勝手なタイミングなんだけど\nうんうん。\nなんかど、そう、すごい\nや\n何かやったほうが、楽しいな、ってなって今。今はそういう空気だから結構色々やってるけど、いや全然なんかもうほんとずっと寝たいって時はあった。あるし\nえーえー、やでも\nそう。きてたから。", "language": "ja", "group": "ingcrowd-themed-dialogue", "source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue10/japanese-themed-dialogue10_audio.wav", "transcript_source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue10/japanese-themed-dialogue10.eaf", "license": "CC BY-NC 4.0", "credit": "IngCrowd Inc., Japanese Themed Casual Conversation Corpus", "theme": "Education, academic subjects, and science", "start_seconds": 528.455, "end_seconds": 568.6, "duration_seconds": 40.145, "transcript_granularity": "publisher human verbatim, timestamped speaker turns", "annotation_ids": ["a269", "a270", "a271", "a115", "a272", "a273", "a116", "a117", "a274", "a118", "a275", "a276", "a277", "a119", "a278"], "transcript_policy": "Sort ELAN segments by start time, retain spoken fills and source punctuation, omit the laughter markup. Separate overlapping turns in start-time order.", "sha256": "fa3e5d1b036a85391f2eecdb6cedb1469bb9ec060720bd843eb5c54cc3070e97"}
